- Credit Accounts Payable.

Expense paid in cash:
- Debit Expense Account.
- Credit Cash Account.

Customer payment:
- Debit Cash/Bank.
- Credit Accounts Receivable.

Supplier payment:
- Debit Accounts Payable.
- Credit Cash/Bank.

